DOCKER COMMANDS
FROM: Defines base images
WORK DIR: Current working directory
COPY and ADD: like Crul, we use Add to extract apps from urls and the zip files
RUN and CMD: Compile and run/execute the file
Env: Setting up paths

docker login → Docker hub user name and password
docker tag <image ID> <dockerhub login>/demobook:v1
